# Normalize all text files to LF.
# The repo is formatted for LF (prettier defaults); on Windows, a global
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check files out as CRLF and make
# `npm run lint` fail with thousands of "Delete ␍" errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never convert or diff.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
